00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:19,240
must know by now.

292
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:21,039
Don't take those rumors to heart.

293
00:13:21,559 --> 00:13:22,799
I don't believe

294
00:13:22,799 --> 00:13:24,039
a word of them.

295
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:26,080
His Majesty...

296
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:27,840
His Majesty won't either.

297
00:13:33,759 --> 00:13:34,440
Tinghui,

298
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:36,399
be honest with me.

299
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:38,399
Do you have feelings

300
00:13:40,639 --> 00:13:41,600
for His Majesty?

301
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:52,200
Of course not.

302
00:13:56,039 --> 00:13:57,679
I saw you two were so close,

303
00:13:57,759 --> 00:13:58,679
so I thought...

304
00:14:00,519 --> 00:14:01,480
Good. I'm glad.

305
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:03,440
The royal family is

306
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:05,759
full of rules and dangers.

307
00:14:05,759 --> 00:14:07,480
One misstep and you lose your life.

308
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:08,639
Besides, His Majesty

309
00:14:08,919 --> 00:14:10,279
has yet to name an empress but is

310
00:14:10,279 --> 00:14:11,519
already preparing to take concubines.

311
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:13,639
In time, the palace will be full

312
00:14:14,279 --> 00:14:15,080
of scheming and rivalry.

313
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:16,639
That life is not for you.

314
00:14:27,879 --> 00:14:28,720
In my eyes,

315
00:14:29,399 --> 00:14:31,759
you deserve the best.

316
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:38,960
Grandmaster.

317
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:40,559
The partnership with Ling Yunfei

318
00:14:40,559 --> 00:14:41,679
on the Godsgrain trade

319
00:14:41,879 --> 00:14:43,639
has brought in 30,000 taels so far.

320
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:45,320
As for the Wan Mountain mine,

321
00:14:45,519 --> 00:14:47,240
Shen Zhishu had it sealed,

322
00:14:47,639 --> 00:14:48,759
so to avoid disrupting our plans,

323
00:14:49,039 --> 00:14:50,399
I've found another route.

324
00:14:50,759 --> 00:14:51,799
I purchased 300 weapons

325
00:14:51,799 --> 00:14:53,120
on the Northsunder black market.

326
00:14:53,279 --> 00:14:54,559
They'll be delivered in seven days.

327
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:55,519
It won't affect

328
00:14:55,519 --> 00:14:56,840
any Crimson Conclave operations.

329
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:58,000
Grandmaster, returning

330
00:14:58,519 --> 00:15:00,120
to the old Midvale lands in Qingzhou,

331
00:15:00,399 --> 00:15:01,200
we found

332
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:02,559
the recent floods devastating.

333
00:15:03,039 --> 00:15:04,799
The court officials breached the dikes

334
00:15:04,879 --> 00:15:06,159
and flooded the Midvale survivors' place

335
00:15:06,519 --> 00:15:07,320
to protect the upper fields.

336
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:08,919
Half of the Midvale Camps are underwater,

337
00:15:09,559 --> 00:15:10,639
bodies floating

338
00:15:10,639 --> 00:15:11,799
on the surface.

339
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:13,120
The youngest was

340
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:14,960
only three years old.

341
00:15:16,039 --> 00:15:16,639
Many are

342
00:15:16,639 --> 00:15:18,039
eating tree bark,

343
00:15:18,559 --> 00:15:20,279
some fighting dogs for scraps.

344
00:15:20,879 --> 00:15:21,720
Many elders

345
00:15:21,879 --> 00:15:23,399
starved to death to save food

346
00:15:24,759 --> 00:15:25,720
for their grandchildren.

347
00:15:30,679 --> 00:15:31,320
Grandmaster,

348
00:15:32,039 --> 00:15:34,039
our people are suffering.

349
00:15:34,519 --> 00:15:35,399
Should the money be

350
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:37,639
used for weapons as planned,

351
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:39,919
or for grain and medicine

352
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:41,279
to aid them?

353
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:42,600
The weapons trade is

354
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:44,240
a death‑defying business.

355
00:15:44,919 --> 00:15:45,919
If we back out now,

356
00:15:46,279 --> 00:15:47,000
no one

357
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:48,039
in the underworld will trust our

358
00:15:48,039 --> 00:15:48,639
Crimson Conclave again.

359
00:15:49,080 --> 00:15:49,840
But weapons can wait,

360
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:50,720
lives cannot.

361
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:52,799
Ten years of endurance

362
00:15:53,679 --> 00:15:54,559
cannot be

363
00:15:54,559 --> 00:15:55,519
undone by

364
00:15:55,519 --> 00:15:56,720
a few starved elders.

365
00:15:57,600 --> 00:15:58,879
When we reclaim our land,

366
00:15:59,279 --> 00:16:01,039
the Great Ning officials will

367
00:16:01,720 --> 00:16:03,480
pay in blood.

368
00:16:04,519 --> 00:16:05,279
Grandmaster,

369
00:16:06,440 --> 00:16:07,399
if our people die, then our

370
00:16:08,120 --> 00:16:09,559
grievance is no longer a blood debt.

371
00:16:10,399 --> 00:16:12,080
If we lose these last survivors,

372
00:16:13,279 --> 00:16:14,240
what use are weapons alone?

373
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,080
The restoration

374
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:20,159
cannot afford softness.

375
00:16:22,399 --> 00:16:23,639
The dead women and children

376
00:16:24,200 --> 00:16:25,600
will fuel outrage

377
00:16:26,559 --> 00:16:29,399
and help us recruit more loyal fighters.

378
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:33,759
I sealed the private mine,

379
00:16:33,879 --> 00:16:34,879
but they seem to have realized

380
00:16:34,879 --> 00:16:35,679
I was tracking them.

381
00:16:35,759 --> 00:16:36,759
They changed course suddenly,

382
00:16:36,759 --> 00:16:37,480
bought spices

383
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:38,879
and timber at a border market,

384
00:16:38,879 --> 00:16:39,639
and then went quiet.

385
00:16:40,519 --> 00:16:41,600
Sudden detour...

386
00:16:42,039 --> 00:16:42,799
Perhaps Situ Xue

387
00:16:42,799 --> 00:16:44,000
tipped them off.

388
00:16:44,679 --> 00:16:45,919
I thought the same,

389
00:16:45,919 --> 00:16:47,000
so I pretended not

390
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:47,799
to notice

391
00:16:47,799 --> 00:16:48,600
and diverted

392
00:16:48,639 --> 00:16:50,039
toward Shazhou.

393
00:16:50,240 --> 00:16:51,600
In truth, I had my men

394
00:16:51,679 --> 00:16:52,639
watching in secret,

395
00:16:53,039 --> 00:16:54,080
and they found this.

396
00:16:57,759 --> 00:16:58,960
The Crimson Conclave.

397
00:16:59,639 --> 00:17:00,960
It seems Situ Xue and Huiyin Studio

398
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:01,840
are just a front.

399
00:17:02,519 --> 00:17:03,279
They work

400
00:17:03,279 --> 00:17:04,799
for the Crimson Conclave in secret.

401
00:17:06,120 --> 00:17:07,080
This Crimson Conclave

402
00:17:07,799 --> 00:17:09,000
may be the ones

403
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:10,840
purchasing arms in Shazhou.

404
00:17:11,319 --> 00:17:12,480
So what

405
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:13,920
are they after,

406
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:15,279
buying weapons in bulk,

407
00:17:15,599 --> 00:17:17,319
and mining privately

408
00:17:17,599 --> 00:17:18,640
when that failed?

409
00:17:18,759 --> 00:17:19,480
Do you recall

410
00:17:19,480 --> 00:17:20,319
what I told you about

411
00:17:20,960 --> 00:17:22,200
the lost Midvale royal family?

412
00:17:22,200 --> 00:17:23,000
After their fall,

413
00:17:23,279 --> 00:17:24,319
a mysterious force

414
00:17:24,319 --> 00:17:25,160
vanished without a trace.

415
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:26,599
This Crimson Conclave

416
00:17:26,599 --> 00:17:27,839
may be connected to them.

417
00:17:28,240 --> 00:17:29,559
Are you planning to restore their kingdom?

418
00:17:31,519 --> 00:17:32,519
That explains the Wraith-lily's

419
00:17:32,519 --> 00:17:33,519
intention of vengeance.

420
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:35,160
So they've been plotting

421
00:17:35,160 --> 00:17:36,359
restoration all along.

422
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:37,279
Your Majesty,

423
00:17:37,720 --> 00:17:38,279
should we

424
00:17:38,279 --> 00:17:39,519
seal Huiyin Studio now?

425
00:17:39,839 --> 00:17:40,400
Not yet.

426
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:43,119
The Crimson Conclave hasn't revealed itself.

427
00:17:43,359 --> 00:17:45,400
Moving now would only take down a few pawns.

428
00:17:45,559 --> 00:17:46,839
Keep watching Huiyin Studio.

429
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:48,519
Follow Situ Xue's trail,

430
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:49,559
that will lead

431
00:17:49,559 --> 00:17:50,880
to the real mastermind.

432
00:17:51,599 --> 00:17:52,039
Understood.

433
00:17:55,119 --> 00:17:55,759
Your Majesty,

434
00:17:56,119 --> 00:17:57,400
I've reported everything.

435
00:17:57,559 --> 00:17:59,119
Now, grant me some clarity.

436
00:17:59,599 --> 00:18:00,200
That Yan girl

437
00:18:00,200 --> 00:18:01,359
sobbed all the way

438
00:18:01,359 --> 00:18:02,640
back from Shazhou.

439
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:04,519
Lord Meng was already wronged, and then

440
00:18:04,519 --> 00:18:06,079
the Astrology Bureau spun a celestial tale.

441
00:18:06,279 --> 00:18:07,680
Even Chancellor Xu used it to attack her.

442
00:18:08,079 --> 00:18:08,920
I really

443
00:18:09,240 --> 00:18:10,599
feel sorry for her.

444
00:18:12,640 --> 00:18:13,480
Would Your Majesty

445
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:15,720
consider reassigning her?

446
00:18:16,200 --> 00:18:17,279
If she gave up,

447
00:18:17,279 --> 00:18:18,640
she wouldn't be Meng Tinghui.

448
00:18:18,799 --> 00:18:20,119
She's after the Tiger Roar Gang

449
00:18:20,480 --> 00:18:21,960
no longer for personal revenge,

450
00:18:22,319 --> 00:18:23,759
but for the people of Great Ning.

451
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:25,519
I want you to take

452
00:18:25,519 --> 00:18:26,920
on the Surveillance Bureau

453
00:18:27,519 --> 00:18:28,880
alongside your current duties,

454
00:18:29,200 --> 00:18:30,119
and protect her.

455
00:18:32,200 --> 00:18:33,920
Your Majesty's regard

456
00:18:34,119 --> 00:18:35,200
for Lord Meng runs

457
00:18:35,200 --> 00:18:36,160
deeper than I expected.

458
00:18:36,960 --> 00:18:38,839
Yet you still plan to marry

459
00:18:38,839 --> 00:18:40,240
the Minister Wen's daughter?

460
00:19:08,480 --> 00:19:09,039
My Lord,

461
00:19:09,440 --> 00:19:10,599
I made this rain-chime.

462
00:19:14,200 --> 00:19:15,200
Even in the rain,

463
00:19:15,839 --> 00:19:16,960
you can see a rainbow in it.

464
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:18,400
That's a good sign.

465
00:19:19,039 --> 00:19:19,720
Soon,

466
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:21,640
the storm will pass.

467
00:19:22,200 --> 00:19:22,759
They say

468
00:19:22,759 --> 00:19:24,480
skill surpassing nature is impossible,

469
00:19:25,200 --> 00:19:27,480
but you've proven them wrong.

470
00:19:30,200 --> 00:19:31,400
I haven't seen you smile in so long.

471
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:33,720
You look beautiful when you smile.

472
00:19:35,079 --> 00:19:36,519
Even the rainbow

473
00:19:37,240 --> 00:19:38,079
pales

474
00:19:38,960 --> 00:19:39,720
beside you.

475
00:19:41,480 --> 00:19:42,680
Stop flattering me.

476
00:19:44,079 --> 00:19:44,759
My Lord,

477
00:19:45,880 --> 00:19:47,240
no storm

478
00:19:48,160 --> 00:19:49,599
lasts forever.

479
00:19:52,240 --> 00:19:53,799
I cannot stop the rain,

480
00:19:54,960 --> 00:19:56,759
but I can use its power.

481
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:14,720
This is a little trinket I keep with me.

482
00:20:15,400 --> 00:20:16,440
Take it for your protection.

483
00:20:26,119 --> 00:20:27,599
If real danger comes,

484
00:20:29,079 --> 00:20:30,559
a trinket won't be enough.

485
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:32,240
I've learned from you

486
00:20:32,839 --> 00:20:33,960
after all this time.

487
00:20:34,519 --> 00:20:35,279
I've prepared

488
00:20:35,279 --> 00:20:36,519
a better solution for you.

489
00:20:37,119 --> 00:20:37,880
This is a sleeve-crossbow,

490
00:20:38,480 --> 00:20:39,799
easy to wear, concealed,

491
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:41,160
and won't harm you.

492
00:20:45,799 --> 00:20:46,799
Colored marbles.

493
00:20:53,079 --> 00:20:53,680
Throwing darts.

494
00:20:56,440 --> 00:20:57,160
And this...

495
00:20:59,960 --> 00:21:00,640
Yin Qing...

496
00:21:02,680 --> 00:21:03,400
thank you.

497
00:21:07,839 --> 00:21:08,440
My Lord,

498
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:10,599
as long as I am here,

499
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:12,400
I will keep you safe.

500
00:21:42,640 --> 00:21:44,559
Who dares trespass the Surveillance Bureau?

501
00:22:29,839 --> 00:22:30,799
Greetings, Your Majesty.

502
00:22:34,400 --> 00:22:34,960
Rise.

503
00:22:37,720 --> 00:22:38,319
Your Majesty,

504
00:22:39,200 --> 00:22:39,799
this is...

505
00:22:44,160 --> 00:22:45,599
Greetings, Lady Meng.

506
00:22:46,680 --> 00:22:48,000
When the Bureau was founded,

507
00:22:48,160 --> 00:22:49,599
I didn't assign it proper personnel,

508
00:22:49,799 --> 00:22:50,880
it was my oversight.

509
00:22:51,119 --> 00:22:52,440
I hand-picked these twelve

510
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:53,599
mounted guards.

511
00:22:53,599 --> 00:22:54,680
They are all skilled warriors.

512
00:22:55,119 --> 00:22:56,039
From today on,

513
00:22:56,240 --> 00:22:57,559
they are under Bureau command

514
00:22:57,680 --> 00:22:58,680
and at your disposal.

515
00:23:02,240 --> 00:23:02,880
Lady Meng,

516
00:23:03,759 --> 00:23:04,519
give your

517
00:23:04,519 --> 00:23:05,359
new unit a name.

518
00:23:13,240 --> 00:23:14,200
Thank you, Your Majesty!

519
00:23:19,960 --> 00:23:20,920
From today,

520
00:23:21,279 --> 00:23:21,880
you are the Light Cavalry

521
00:23:21,880 --> 00:23:23,240
of the Surveillance Bureau.

522
00:23:23,920 --> 00:23:26,000
Light as a shadow, swift as the wind.

523
00:23:26,640 --> 00:23:27,720
Blades unseen,

524
00:23:28,720 --> 00:23:29,960
a single strike is what it takes.

525
00:23:31,960 --> 00:23:33,880
Thank you for the name, Lord Meng!

526
00:23:33,880 --> 00:23:36,519
We swear our lives

527
00:23:36,519 --> 00:23:37,920
to the Bureau and to you.

528
00:24:03,440 --> 00:24:04,680
I've sent for the imperial physician,

529
00:24:05,480 --> 00:24:06,200
they'll be here soon.

530
00:24:13,079 --> 00:24:14,400
The rain has not stopped.

531
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:16,599
Aren't you afraid of this sorceress?

532
00:24:16,839 --> 00:24:18,000
When did I ever

533
00:24:18,000 --> 00:24:18,960
believe such nonsense?

534
00:24:20,039 --> 00:24:21,079
Your Ten Measures are

535
00:24:21,359 --> 00:24:22,839
already being carried out by Chancellor Gu.

536
00:24:23,079 --> 00:24:24,240
The flood relief is showing results.

537
00:24:27,880 --> 00:24:29,160
You drew a sword that day.

538
00:24:29,880 --> 00:24:30,680
Weren't you afraid Chancellor Xu

539
00:24:30,680 --> 00:24:31,680
would charge you with treason?

540
00:24:41,279 --> 00:24:42,559
The Tiger Roar Gang and their protectors

541
00:24:42,759 --> 00:24:43,880
in court are not yet uprooted.

542
00:24:44,519 --> 00:24:44,960
I won't allow you

543
00:24:44,960 --> 00:24:46,240
to get yourself killed

544
00:24:46,839 --> 00:24:47,720
for some bronze plate

545
00:24:47,720 --> 00:24:48,960
and lose your chance at vengeance.

546
00:24:53,960 --> 00:24:55,160
I'm not afraid of impeachment.

547
00:24:55,920 --> 00:24:57,680
Some things must be done.

548
00:24:58,240 --> 00:24:59,119
The star read

549
00:25:00,200 --> 00:25:01,119
and the slander

550
00:25:01,480 --> 00:25:02,599
were meant to ruin my name.

551
00:25:04,240 --> 00:25:05,160
But I don't care. They dictated

552
00:25:05,759 --> 00:25:07,599
the realm's fate at the observatory,

553
00:25:07,839 --> 00:25:09,680
so I had to tear down the heavenly script

554
00:25:10,559 --> 00:25:11,480
and show them that

555
00:25:12,240 --> 00:25:13,400
their so-called divine punishment

556
00:25:14,039 --> 00:25:15,240
is nothing but a lie.

557
00:25:22,839 --> 00:25:23,839
They used the star read

558
00:25:23,839 --> 00:25:24,720
to attack you,

559
00:25:25,599 --> 00:25:27,200
but it was really a way to show

560
00:25:27,200 --> 00:25:28,519
their displeasure with my reforms.

561
00:25:29,519 --> 00:25:30,279
You've suffered.

562
00:25:30,880 --> 00:25:32,640
I've never believed in that nonsense.

563
00:25:33,720 --> 00:25:34,599
I trust you.

564
00:25:38,000 --> 00:25:38,960
I'm not upset.

565
00:25:40,039 --> 00:25:41,240
You use me as a blade

566
00:25:41,480 --> 00:25:42,519
to purge the court's corruption.

567
00:25:43,039 --> 00:25:44,000
That's my honor.

568
00:25:44,839 --> 00:25:46,480
Whether it's the Gang or their protectors,

569
00:25:49,880 --> 00:25:51,279
I will see it through to the end.

570
00:25:52,039 --> 00:25:54,240
I will act with more resolve.

571
00:25:55,319 --> 00:25:56,440
I will do what

572
00:25:56,880 --> 00:25:57,599
you can't do.

573
00:25:58,160 --> 00:25:59,960
I know you won't back down.

574
00:26:00,640 --> 00:26:01,559
Beyond the Light Cavalry,

575
00:26:01,880 --> 00:26:03,599
I will assign Di Nian and Shen Zhishu

576
00:26:03,599 --> 00:26:04,319
to your Bureau

577
00:26:04,519 --> 00:26:05,920
to help you dig deeper.

578
00:26:06,200 --> 00:26:07,079
And I

579
00:26:07,960 --> 00:26:09,720
will support your every move.

580
00:26:13,079 --> 00:26:14,480
Thank you, Your Majesty!

581
00:26:25,279 --> 00:26:27,200
After posting the sketches,

582
00:26:27,839 --> 00:26:28,799
the Bureau received

583
00:26:28,799 --> 00:26:30,160
